003e;T</sub>(<bold>C</bold>) a three-group subdivision was used: 0&#x0003d;CC, 1&#x0003d;CT, 2&#x0003d;TT. Status: 0&#x0003d;alive or not tumour-related death, 1&#x0003d;tumour-related death.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="gif" xlink:href="95-6603307f2"/></fig><fig id="fig3"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Survival curves using tumour-related death for 79 gastric cancer patients subdivided by the presence of combined polymorphisms in the MMP-7 gene (&#x02212;181A&#x0003e;G) and TIMP-2 gene (303C&#x0003e;T).</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="95-6603307f3"/></fig><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Primer sequences and PCR conditions for amplification of MMP and TIMP SNPs</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/><col align="left"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>SNP</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Method</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Primer</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Sequence</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Location</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Annealing</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>BP</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Enzyme</bold></th><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Reference</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">MMP-2<sub>&#x02212;1575G&#x0003e;A</sub></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RFLP-PCR</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Outer primers</td><td